{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Live-Bedrock AC evidence (STANDARD slot = bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-sonnet-4-6, FRONTIER = opus-4-8; temperature=0 greedy per e458 / capabilities.py:299). All runs `rebar verify-completion <id> --no-graph --source local --ref HEAD` from worktree impl-10ae-verifier-ctx @ HEAD, usage via REBAR_USAGE_LOG.\n\n**AC \"Incremental-banking live\" (primary banks >=1 before dying):** Induced exhaustion on THIS ticket (19 criteria) via the story's own levers step_floor_min=74 -> primary request_limit=37. Log line: `completion recovery: primary banked 14 of 19 criteria before exhaustion` (completion_recovery.py handoff INFO log). Primary hit its step budget at requests=37, recovery successors + finalizer then produced a full-coverage verdict. A prior run at the same budget banked 9/19 — both >=1. (At request_limit=35 the primary banked 0: the burst is late, which is why the incremental-banking prompt push matters.)\n\n**AC \"Spend below fan-out\":** Same induced run, total requests across primary + 2 successor batches + finalizer = **112** (37+37+37+1), well below the 440-request per-criterion fan-out worst case for 19 criteria. Second induced run measured 149. Both << 440.\n\n**AC \"Cache reuse across primary->successor\":** Same induced run, successor usage rows show cache_read_tokens = **1,554,925** and **1,945,314** (primary 2,739,194) — the shared system-prompt + tool-definition prefix hit the automatic Bedrock prompt cache (cache_settings_for / capabilities.py) rather than being re-billed. cache-read >> 0 on every successor. Healthy-path runs corroborate (f6fc successor cache_read 447k/609k).\n\n**AC \"Healthy-path quality (verdict class unchanged, >=3 tickets, greedy pinned):** 3 healthy multi-criterion already-closed tickets re-verified under the shipped banking prompt, all PASS (class unchanged from their closed state):\n- f6fc-27fe-d3af-4f87 (8 criteria) -> PASS\n- 01f8-11eb-4772-4c80 (2 criteria) -> PASS\n- 02e9-db02-348f-4627 (7 criteria) -> PASS\nGreedy decoding is pinned: Pass-2 verifiers send temperature=0 (capabilities.py:299)."},"env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1786081437022628001,"uuid":"de3f901c-8b42-49c9-b7fb-dff48d8cbdba"}